title: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> checks upon our progress in accomplishing the coalition's goals in Heartland...
view-if: (in_popular_front_heartland or in_left_front_heartland) and collectivist_ultimatum_heartland_timer = 0 and collectivist_goals_seen_heartland = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.collectivist_goals_completed_heartland = 0;
if (Q.interior_goal_heartland <= 0) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed_heartland += 1
}
if (Q.bureaucracy_goal_heartland <= 0) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed_heartland += 1
}
if (Q.vanguard_goal_heartland <= 0) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed_heartland += 1
}
if (Q.free_collectivist_goal_heartland <= 0) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed_heartland += 1
}
Q.collectivist_goals_seen_heartland = 0
!}
new-page: true
tags: event
go-to: goals_success if collectivist_goals_completed_heartland >= 4; goals_failed if collectivist_goals_completed_heartland < 4

= <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> Goals

At the start of this government, the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> presented a list of goals for the Heartland coalition:

[? if interior_goal_seen_heartland = 1 : - Ban the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> and <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>. - [? if interior_goal_heartland <= 0 : success ?][? if interior_goal_heartland >= 1: failed ?] ?]

[? if vanguard_goal_seen_heartland = 1 : - Unban the <span style="color: #700000;">**Vanguard**</span>. - [? if vanguard_goal_heartland <= 0: success ?][? if vanguard_goal_heartland >= 1: failed ?] ?]

[? if bureaucracy_goal_seen_heartland = 1 : - Purge the bureaucracy. - [? if bureaucracy_goal_heartland <= 0: success ?][? if bureaucracy_goal_heartland >= 1: failed ?] ?]

[? if free_collectivist_goal_seen_heartland = 1 : - Protect <span style="color: #700000;">collectivist</span> demonstrations. - [? if free_collectivist_goal_heartland <= 0: success ?][? if free_collectivist_goal_heartland >= 1: failed ?] ?]

@goals_failed
on-arrival: collectivist_relation -= 8; commons_marcher -= 4; disfavored_marcher -= 4; commons_collectivist += 4; vanguard_strength += 100; vanguard_militancy += 0.05; in_popular_front_heartland = 0; in_left_front_heartland = 0; heartland_leader = "Bristol"; collectivist_coalition_dissent += 2

Unfortunately, we have failed to accomplish all of the goals the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> set out. They plan to call a vote of no confidence against our government, and have already begun mounting a propaganda campaign to delegitimize our government in the eyes of the workers.

- @new_elections: New elections will be called.
- @skibidi: Could we form a new government based on the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist: (and possibly <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?]?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]?

@goals_success
on-arrival: commons_marcher += 4; disfavored_marcher += 4; collectivist_relation += 6; commons_collectivist += 4; collectivist_coalition_success += 1; vanguard_strength += 150; vanguard_militancy += 0.1; reichsexekution += 1

As expected, we have completed the goals set by the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>. [? if president == "DuFour": However, over the past few months, President DuFour's concerns over our coalition government have grown... ?]

@skibidi
subtitle: The talks lead nowhere.

The feelers go out and come back empty: no propertied party will prop up our government while the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> hound it from the left. New elections it must be.

@new_elections
call: set_next_election_time_prussia

New Heartland elections have been set for [+ next_election_month_heartland : month +] [+ next_election_year_heartland + 2365 +].
